    "code": "\tSELECTOR\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tDO MoveToKnownObjectLocation\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectInReach? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO GrabObject\n\t\tELSE\n\t\t\tDO CheckObjectProperties\n\t\t\tDO MoveToDeliveryLocation\n\t\t\tDO DeliverObject\n\t\tEND\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tDO ScanAreaForObject\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectVisible? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO MoveToObject\n\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
